    "Have you backed up your BitLocker key?",
    "The next KB is already downloading.",
    "Telemetry says you're enjoying this.",
    "May contain traces of quality assurance.",
    "Clippy would never have allowed this.",
    "Uptime is a preview feature.",
    "Insiders saw this coming. Nobody listened.",
    "Microslop hasn't slopped. Yet.",
    "Windows Update is respecting your boundaries today.",
    "No known issues. Plenty of unknown ones.",
    "The update button is thinking about it.",
    "Your taskbar survived another sunrise.",
    "All systems nominal-ish.",
    "The blue screen is merely resting.",
    "Windows is stable. Please don't startle it.",
    "OneDrive has backed up your sense of dread.",
    "The rollback partition remains optimistic.",
    "Microsoft calls this a quality moment.",
    "Your settings are still where you left them.",
    "No emergency out-of-band patch. Suspicious.",
    "The Start menu started. Huge if true.",
    "Copilot couldn't find anything wrong. Adorable.",
    "Copilot is summarizing your impending reboot.",
    "Clippy never needed a cloud connection to interrupt you.",
    "Copilot hallucinated a stable release channel.",
    "Clippy never wanted your data. Just your letter.",
    "The mascot is optional. The telemetry has tenure.",
    "Mico changed color. We assume that's fine.",
    "Mico is listening. Windows Update isn't.",
    "Clippy was annoying, not emotionally available.",
    "Mico is customizable. The forced reboot is not.",
    "Defender is guarding the uptime with its life.",
    "Mico nodded. Legal says that isn't a guarantee.",
    "Windows Recall remembers when updates worked.",
    "Mico supports you through animation, not tech support.",
    "No news is good news. Or unacknowledged news.",
