    "Every quiet day is just update buffering.",
    "Enjoy this unsupported level of stability.",
    "Nothing broke. Telemetry is inconclusive.",
    "Current status: ominously functional.",
    "A fix has not yet required another fix.",
    "The PC is fine. Mico looks nervous.",
