    "BitLocker hasn't requested your recovery key. Cherish this.",
    "Your recovery key is enjoying a well-earned day off.",
    "Windows Security says no action is needed. Famous last words.",
    "Defender's threat history is shorter than Windows Update's.",
    "Clippy was retired before he had to explain this roadmap.",
    "Clippy sees you're trying to keep Windows working.",
    "The paperclip retired. The problems got promoted.",
    "Copilot has drafted an apology, just in case.",
    "Mico is here to make the error dialog feel natural.",
    "Windows Update checked for updates and, for once, respected the answer.",
    "The printer still works. Nobody touch anything.",
    "Today's optional preview remains emotionally optional.",
    "The uptime survived a meeting that could have been a reboot.",
